  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Refactor the Code\r\n\r\nThis `.then()` promise chain loads advice from the [Random Advice API](https://api.adviceslip.com/advice) but the code is hard to read.\r\n\r\nYour task is to refactor the code in `script.js` using `async` and `await`. You can use AI Tutor to suggest next steps and help you debug your code.\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n**Discuss:** \r\n\r\n- What differences do you notice between the manually refactored code on this level and AI refactored code in the previous level?\r\n- Which version do you prefer to use? ",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "placeholderText": "",
